WEBVTT

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:07.440
You sound really excited, Wassan.

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:09.940
Well of course I am, Torigaya.

00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:15.700
After all, to deepen my relationship with Ikaruga-san...

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:16.410
Oh!

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:17.120
Yes!

00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:20.620
...we're going camping at the beach tomorrow!

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:24.960
Huh?

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:27.750
Wassan, this isn't tomorrow, it's today.

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:28.570
Wh—

00:00:29.110 --> 00:00:31.000
What?!

00:00:39.610 --> 00:00:44.910
It doesn't matter when

00:00:45.010 --> 00:00:50.340
I always think of your smile

00:00:50.470 --> 00:00:55.810
The single word that I couldn't say

00:00:55.850 --> 00:01:01.010
I've always wanted to say it to you

00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:04.490
I pray so that our hearts may be connected

00:01:04.350 --> 00:01:07.230
But I couldn't see through the clouds

00:01:07.070 --> 00:01:11.980
In front of you, I swear that

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:14.840
I will always be your side

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:21.720
The future we anticipate is still far away

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:25.280
You say that it's at the end of the world

00:01:25.300 --> 00:01:30.950
As long as I have a reason to shed tears

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:35.810
I will not stop moving towards it

00:01:35.610 --> 00:01:45.740
As usual, we'll be together today

00:01:35.610 --> 00:01:41.840
bokutachi wa nani mo kawarazu ni

00:01:41.690 --> 00:01:45.740
kyou mo tonari ni iru

00:01:47.190 --> 00:01:51.190
In the same world

00:02:01.050 --> 00:02:06.390
Seventh Longsword

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:06.390
Separating the
White Swimsuit

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:06.390
from the School Swimsuit

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:12.900
With no one here, it feels so great.

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:17.450
Renting an entire island still feels like a dream to me.

00:02:17.450 --> 00:02:19.110
Yeah!

00:02:19.110 --> 00:02:22.350
We should really register for more of these giveaways.

00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:23.930
My, aren't you a housewife.

00:02:23.930 --> 00:02:24.910
Umm,

00:02:25.110 --> 00:02:28.370
thank you for inviting us, too.

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:29.650
Of course.

00:02:29.650 --> 00:02:31.420
The more the merrier.

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:32.960
That's great.

00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:35.070
I'd never been to the beach.

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:38.930
It's so great that I'm doing something normal like hanging out at the beach.

00:02:39.570 --> 00:02:43.830
If my prince shows up and this turns into a date...

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:46.430
Try and catch me!

00:02:47.440 --> 00:02:49.940
Slow down, missy.

00:02:49.940 --> 00:02:53.190
I invited Washizu-kun, but he didn't come.

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:58.060
Well, Tsubasa-sama, now that we've come to the beach...

00:03:02.090 --> 00:03:04.990
So it's your first time going to the beach as well?

00:03:05.360 --> 00:03:06.810
I am in the same shoes as you are.

00:03:09.380 --> 00:03:10.500
A loincloth?!

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:13.720
Ka-Karasuma-kun,

00:03:13.720 --> 00:03:17.050
I don't think I'd call that normal.

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:20.260
This is indeed normal for me.

00:03:20.950 --> 00:03:22.300
I see.

00:03:22.690 --> 00:03:24.950
A strong, well-trained physique.

00:03:24.950 --> 00:03:27.220
An ideal body for a swordsman.

00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:31.250
What's wrong, Angie?

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:32.460
I'm not!

00:03:32.460 --> 00:03:33.480
I'm not love struck.

00:03:39.310 --> 00:03:41.320
My lovely Ikaruga sisters...

00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:44.240
welcome to my private beach.

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:48.240
It won't be long until they lose all their excitement.

00:03:49.230 --> 00:03:50.500
Mizunagi brothers...

00:03:52.380 --> 00:03:57.040
You will deal him a loss even more disgraceful than death.

00:03:57.040 --> 00:03:58.280
Yes.

00:03:58.280 --> 00:04:01.900
I will sink Karasuma Yoichi to the depths of the cold sea.

00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:03.000
Do not underestimate him.

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:04.340
Don't worry.

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:07.850
We're invincible on the waves.

00:04:08.090 --> 00:04:10.890
We'll see how you do...

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:12.890
Damn it...

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:15.370
Everyone's showing off their big breasts.

00:04:15.370 --> 00:04:17.360
Here's my way of fighting you.

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:22.040
Kagome, you understand how I feel, right?

00:04:22.040 --> 00:04:23.810
As a fellow flat-chest.

00:04:23.810 --> 00:04:26.290
I don't really...

00:04:26.290 --> 00:04:29.910
I guess you still wouldn't understand, being a kid.

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:32.180
When you have someone you like, too...

00:04:32.180 --> 00:04:34.870
I'm not saying that I do!

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:44.380
These aren't so different from my loinclo—

00:04:48.270 --> 00:04:50.890
I didn't know this was the girls' dressing room.

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:52.390
You bastard!

00:04:52.610 --> 00:04:54.470
I'm so sorry my chest is small!

00:04:54.470 --> 00:04:57.600
What is she talking about?

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:02.590
Ibuki-sensei!

00:05:02.590 --> 00:05:03.610
Yes?

00:05:04.630 --> 00:05:06.420
Where's Kagome-chan?

00:05:06.420 --> 00:05:08.810
I think she's still changing.

00:05:08.810 --> 00:05:11.160
Man, she's always so slow.

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:13.870
What's taking her so long to change?

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:18.070
Masashi-kun, your head seems to be full of Kagome-chan.

00:05:18.070 --> 00:05:19.920
I-I'm just...

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:25.100
Masashi-kun also defends her against the bullies.

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:26.580
Really?

00:05:26.580 --> 00:05:27.930
Thank you, Masashi-kun.

00:05:28.230 --> 00:05:29.930
It's not...

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:31.410
Ayame-dono!

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:33.930
I didn't see anything, I tell you!

00:05:34.150 --> 00:05:35.940
Shut up, moron!

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:38.370
That's not the problem!

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:42.440
Ayame-dono, please wait!

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:40.980
That's Karasuma Yoichi?

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:42.440
He's completely defenseless.

00:05:42.770 --> 00:05:45.090
I could probably kill him in my sleep.

00:05:45.090 --> 00:05:48.900
A sneak attack goes against our family's code.

00:05:48.900 --> 00:05:51.600
It's not so easy to restore our school.

00:05:52.280 --> 00:05:53.160
Let's try something.

00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:02.710
Hunt.

00:06:04.020 --> 00:06:07.140
Ayame-dono, please don't be so angry.

00:06:07.140 --> 00:06:09.260
Don't follow me,

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:10.700
stupid Samurai!

00:06:15.410 --> 00:06:16.640
Ayame-dono!

00:06:19.870 --> 00:06:21.210
What is that?

00:06:21.210 --> 00:06:22.400
That bird?

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:26.740
Don't "what is that" me...

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:28.390
you moron!

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:38.210
Tsubasa-dono!

00:06:50.710 --> 00:06:52.430
Amazing, Tsubasa-sama.

00:07:02.430 --> 00:07:06.520
Even when there are children around, how can you...

00:07:06.520 --> 00:07:08.480
No, it's not what you think!

00:07:08.480 --> 00:07:09.790
The bird was...

00:07:10.960 --> 00:07:11.990
Ibuki-dono.

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:16.700
You are truly...

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:19.200
scum!

00:07:20.050 --> 00:07:21.760
It's a misunderstanding.

00:07:21.760 --> 00:07:22.720
It was the bird.

00:07:22.720 --> 00:07:25.270
Why are you such a pervert?!

00:07:25.270 --> 00:07:26.920
When you're cool, you're so—

00:07:27.680 --> 00:07:29.320
Okay, Yoichi-san.

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:32.950
I will beat your horrendous mind back into shape.

00:07:32.950 --> 00:07:35.220
Everyone, start swimming for some training!

00:07:36.130 --> 00:07:38.080
Are you okay, Karasuma?

00:07:38.990 --> 00:07:39.990
That bird...

00:07:40.880 --> 00:07:43.470
Angie-dono, you noticed?

00:07:43.470 --> 00:07:44.590
Yes.

00:07:44.590 --> 00:07:46.320
It looked like it was attacking us,

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:48.230
but is it just aggressive by nature?

00:07:48.680 --> 00:07:50.240
I do not know.

00:07:52.720 --> 00:07:54.420
He does have good instincts.

00:07:54.420 --> 00:07:56.770
It may be harder than I thought.

00:07:56.770 --> 00:07:57.880
Don't worry.

00:07:57.880 --> 00:08:01.120
As long as we get him into the sea or to that cave,

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:03.160
it's a sure win for us.

00:08:03.160 --> 00:08:04.530
Keep going, Tsubasa-sama.

00:08:04.530 --> 00:08:06.900
You must swim and swim and swim till you drop!

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:07.680
No!

00:08:07.680 --> 00:08:10.210
I want to play normally at the beach today.

00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:13.220
Ibuki-sensei, look, we can swim this far already.

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:15.680
You guys are amazing.

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:17.720
Ibuki-dono!

00:08:18.050 --> 00:08:20.730
Well, he did spend his life in the mountains...

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:22.960
You can't swim, Samurai?

00:08:21.450 --> 00:08:22.960
Are you okay, Karasuma?

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:26.100
What?!

00:08:26.100 --> 00:08:27.730
Back off!

00:08:27.730 --> 00:08:29.300
That would be my line.

00:08:29.300 --> 00:08:30.730
I will rescue Karasuma.

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:34.130
What are you pushing out your breasts for?

00:08:34.130 --> 00:08:35.110
You know what?

00:08:35.110 --> 00:08:36.300
If I was as old as you...

00:08:36.300 --> 00:08:37.780
Hey, how old are you?

00:08:38.140 --> 00:08:39.430
I'm 16.

00:08:39.430 --> 00:08:40.790
You got a problem?

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:42.290
What?!

00:08:42.740 --> 00:08:44.720
I lost.

00:08:44.720 --> 00:08:47.710
I don't get it, but I won.

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:50.210
Someone, save me!

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:52.760
Goodness, you're hopeless.

00:08:55.170 --> 00:08:56.560
Ibuki-dono?

00:09:00.610 --> 00:09:02.720
Where are you looking?

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:06.480
Oh, youth.

00:09:10.600 --> 00:09:12.480
What are you doing, Kagome?

00:09:14.190 --> 00:09:15.480
What's wrong, Kagome?

00:09:15.480 --> 00:09:17.280
Take your shirt off.

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:19.480
Let's swim together.

00:09:19.480 --> 00:09:23.030
You mean drown, right, Yoichi-san?

00:09:23.030 --> 00:09:24.200
Ibuki-dono...

00:09:24.550 --> 00:09:27.400
If you can't swim, I'll teach you.

00:09:28.650 --> 00:09:31.900
Look, this is why even in class—

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:33.860
Class?

00:09:33.860 --> 00:09:35.340
Did something happen in class?

00:09:37.030 --> 00:09:40.710
She's always just sitting out in swimming class.

00:09:41.200 --> 00:09:42.150
I didn't know that.

00:09:42.150 --> 00:09:43.370
What's the problem, Kagome?

00:09:43.370 --> 00:09:44.310
Let's go.

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:45.520
No!

00:09:46.320 --> 00:09:48.130
Do you really...

00:09:48.130 --> 00:09:50.730
Are you fine with being useless the whole time?

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:53.860
I'm not useless!

00:09:54.970 --> 00:09:55.860
Kagome!

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:57.860
Hey, come back!

00:09:57.860 --> 00:10:01.030
Hey, Masashi-kun made her cry.

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:02.720
He made her cry and got dumped.

00:10:02.720 --> 00:10:04.870
Shut up, guys!

00:10:05.390 --> 00:10:09.920
I didn't know that she wasn't participating in some classes.

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:12.560
Maybe I spoiled her too much.

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:15.080
No, Ibuki-dono.

00:10:15.530 --> 00:10:20.110
Kagome-dono does not slack off without a reason.

00:10:20.590 --> 00:10:22.960
I'm sure there's a reason for this.

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:27.390
Ibuki-sensei, I'm gonna bring Kagome back.

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:29.680
It's my fault, I said too much.

00:10:30.630 --> 00:10:34.920
The look in Masashi-dono's eyes was that of a fine man.

00:10:35.960 --> 00:10:38.900
He's a student of the Ukiha Kamikaze School, after all.

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:44.750
Maybe I'm lost...

00:10:46.860 --> 00:10:48.290
What should I do?

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:54.090
Kagome!

00:10:59.990 --> 00:11:01.360
Masashi-kun?!

00:11:02.790 --> 00:11:05.050
What's this hole?

00:11:05.050 --> 00:11:06.760
Are you all right, Kagome?

00:11:06.760 --> 00:11:08.760
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:11:08.760 --> 00:11:09.350
Oww.

00:11:11.510 --> 00:11:13.650
Man, you're a real klutz.

00:11:14.460 --> 00:11:17.150
What would you do without me?

00:11:18.160 --> 00:11:20.010
Umm, Masashi-kun?

00:11:21.220 --> 00:11:23.690
Can you close your eyes for a while?

00:11:26.030 --> 00:11:27.160
Like this?

00:11:29.020 --> 00:11:30.160
You can open your eyes now.

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:34.750
What is this?

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:35.310
Cloth?

00:11:35.310 --> 00:11:36.390
Cotton?

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:38.670
Why did you have this?

00:11:39.640 --> 00:11:40.670
Just because.

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:46.960
Well anyways, it looks like we can't climb out of here.

00:11:46.960 --> 00:11:48.060
Yeah.

00:11:51.960 --> 00:11:54.410
There's a path this way, so let's keep going.

00:11:54.900 --> 00:11:56.190
Wait.

00:11:57.050 --> 00:11:59.280
That is a straight road.

00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:02.140
They easily fell for our trap.

00:12:02.140 --> 00:12:05.220
We can trap Karasuma with them as the bait.

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:09.370
Wait for me, Ikaruga-san!

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:12.000
Do your best, Wassan!

00:12:24.860 --> 00:12:27.010
It looks like it's gonna rain.

00:12:27.490 --> 00:12:31.100
The southern weather changes pretty abruptly, huh?

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:33.020
They're still not back yet.

00:12:33.370 --> 00:12:34.770
Could something have happened to them?

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:37.300
We should also split up and search.

00:12:37.300 --> 00:12:38.400
Good idea.

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:40.070
Tsubasa-sama and I will look over here.

00:12:40.070 --> 00:12:40.900
Okay.

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:42.070
Then we'll go this way.

00:12:45.580 --> 00:12:48.530
I didn't think it'd be a cave like this.

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:50.740
Can we get back?

00:12:55.550 --> 00:12:58.660
We still can't find them after all that?

00:12:58.660 --> 00:13:00.630
I wonder where they went...

00:13:06.740 --> 00:13:08.650
Then we can check over—

00:13:09.630 --> 00:13:10.930
Ibuki-dono?

00:13:12.160 --> 00:13:15.110
It's because I said too much.

00:13:15.910 --> 00:13:19.630
Kagome has never been good at sports,

00:13:19.630 --> 00:13:21.650
and maybe she was worried about that.

00:13:22.690 --> 00:13:24.090
Me, too.

00:13:24.090 --> 00:13:26.090
I just ignored her and went off on my own.

00:13:26.640 --> 00:13:28.660
I acted the same way.

00:13:29.930 --> 00:13:32.540
If all you girls put on such faces,

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:36.040
Kagome-dono will blame herself for making you worry.

00:13:36.820 --> 00:13:40.290
Hence, we should welcome her with a smile.

00:13:40.910 --> 00:13:42.320
Samurai.

00:13:43.510 --> 00:13:44.700
Karasuma.

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:46.920
We found something like a hole.

00:13:46.920 --> 00:13:48.990
And something like a cave—

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:57.040
I-I'm sorry.

00:13:57.040 --> 00:13:59.010
I slipped because of the rain.

00:13:59.510 --> 00:14:00.280
That bitch.

00:14:00.280 --> 00:14:01.850
I'll never forgive her!

00:14:02.760 --> 00:14:04.720
That bird! It's the same one.

00:14:04.720 --> 00:14:06.360
It's heading to the cave.

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:07.360
Let's follow it.

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:16.050
I'm sorry.

00:14:16.050 --> 00:14:17.160
It's my fault.

00:14:17.560 --> 00:14:20.210
St-Stupid, why are you crying?

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:21.580
We'll get back for sure.

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:25.120
I'm sorry.

00:14:25.120 --> 00:14:28.870
Besides, I'm the one who should apologize.

00:14:30.830 --> 00:14:33.540
Sorry, I said too much.

00:14:33.540 --> 00:14:36.090
I wasn't trying to be mean.

00:14:36.090 --> 00:14:39.350
I just couldn't leave you alone.

00:14:42.170 --> 00:14:44.420
So I'll teach you how to swim.

00:14:44.420 --> 00:14:46.630
Then no one will make fun of you.

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:49.070
Umm, Masashi-kun,

00:14:49.070 --> 00:14:51.390
that's not actually why...

00:14:53.540 --> 00:14:54.700
It's the exit!

00:15:05.980 --> 00:15:06.750
Masashi-kun!

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:13.720
I don't just play around at the dojo...

00:15:13.720 --> 00:15:15.760
Hold on, I'll do something!

00:15:16.090 --> 00:15:17.410
No, stay back!

00:15:17.410 --> 00:15:18.770
You'll fall, too.

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:20.820
But, then...

00:15:20.820 --> 00:15:22.230
Kagome-dono!

00:15:22.700 --> 00:15:25.310
Yoichi-oniichan, Masashi-kun's...

00:15:31.270 --> 00:15:32.450
Masashi-dono!

00:15:35.820 --> 00:15:37.440
Yoichi-san...

00:15:37.440 --> 00:15:38.950
With no hesitation...

00:15:41.030 --> 00:15:41.960
Help me!

00:15:43.220 --> 00:15:45.480
Don't jump in when you can't swim.

00:15:48.930 --> 00:15:50.960
Didn't think you'd jump in yourself...

00:15:51.530 --> 00:15:54.720
Saginomiya Souten School of Boat Manipulation,

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:57.220
Mizunagi Shiomaru, here for a battle.

00:15:57.720 --> 00:15:59.410
Hey, hey, hey!

00:15:59.410 --> 00:16:02.010
Super surfer who can surf a storm,

00:16:02.010 --> 00:16:04.730
Mizunagi Uzumaru, better get ready!

00:16:05.700 --> 00:16:08.150
This Saginomiya Boat Manipulation Style could be trouble.

00:16:08.770 --> 00:16:10.230
Do you know about them, Angie?

00:16:10.620 --> 00:16:17.200
It's the legendary fighting style that's said to have drowned countless soldiers in naval battles.

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:20.520
Reeeeeeally?

00:16:18.030 --> 00:16:20.520
They aren't really needed for this era, huh?

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:25.130
The field is completely on our side,

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:27.800
but we will not hold back, Karasuma Yoichi.

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:32.670
Feel our techniques to the marrow of your bones!

00:16:32.910 --> 00:16:35.180
We will turn you into scraps in the sea!

00:16:41.160 --> 00:16:42.270
Yoichi-san!

00:16:42.270 --> 00:16:44.270
Someone, get me a sword!

00:16:46.540 --> 00:16:48.270
Here it is, Karasuma!

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:57.700
Yoichi-san!

00:17:02.780 --> 00:17:04.830
Floating only makes you a perfect target!

00:17:06.260 --> 00:17:07.290
Masashi-kun!

00:17:08.030 --> 00:17:11.800
He quickly ran over and saved me.

00:17:12.280 --> 00:17:14.260
It's my turn to save him.

00:17:15.090 --> 00:17:15.880
Kagome!

00:17:25.490 --> 00:17:26.560
Yoichi-oniichan!

00:17:28.600 --> 00:17:30.230
No, you won't!

00:17:32.930 --> 00:17:34.900
Brilliant, Tsubasa-sama.

00:17:35.260 --> 00:17:38.910
This sword entrusted to me by Kagome-dono shall not go to waste.

00:17:39.290 --> 00:17:41.890
What can you do with a single wooden sword?

00:17:41.890 --> 00:17:43.090
Uzumaru, let's go.

00:17:43.090 --> 00:17:44.670
All right, Shiomaru.

00:17:44.670 --> 00:17:47.790
Come on, Grand Swell!

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:57.220
Saginomiya Boat Manipulation Style secret technique,

00:17:57.220 --> 00:17:58.430
Dragon Breaker!

00:18:03.140 --> 00:18:03.970
Samurai!

00:18:11.760 --> 00:18:13.300
No...

00:18:13.300 --> 00:18:14.350
That can't be.

00:18:14.350 --> 00:18:15.610
Yoichi-san.

00:18:16.380 --> 00:18:19.150
Though it's just water, it's several tons of pressure.

00:18:19.150 --> 00:18:20.360
He won't resurface.

00:18:20.710 --> 00:18:25.350
Ukiha Kamikaze School swordsman vanishes into the sea.

00:18:27.070 --> 00:18:28.370
What is that?

00:18:31.970 --> 00:18:36.380
Ukiha Kamikaze School Sword Style, Seventh Technique: Tornado!

00:18:36.940 --> 00:18:38.100
Yoichi-san!

00:18:38.100 --> 00:18:39.880
Nice loincloth!

00:18:42.940 --> 00:18:44.040
Impossible!

00:18:49.930 --> 00:18:52.110
Ukiha Kamikaze School Sword Style,

00:18:52.110 --> 00:18:53.390
Third Technique:

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:54.890
Falcon!

00:18:57.290 --> 00:18:58.480
How?!

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:15.060
The float!

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:19.460
Kagome-dono.

00:19:20.050 --> 00:19:21.880
Kagome!

00:19:21.880 --> 00:19:23.470
You can swim?!

00:19:27.570 --> 00:19:30.360
He blew up the ocean with just his sword pressure.

00:19:31.010 --> 00:19:33.850
Karasuma Yoichi cannot be taken lightly.

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:38.410
And now this large-scale plan of renting an island has gone to waste.

00:19:38.410 --> 00:19:42.270
You're not just bad with handling money, but with your brain as well.

00:19:42.880 --> 00:19:43.860
Oh well.

00:19:44.350 --> 00:19:47.870
I got a nice recording of his moves.

00:19:48.670 --> 00:19:49.910
They're back.

00:19:49.910 --> 00:19:51.140
Masashi-kun!

00:19:51.140 --> 00:19:52.580
Kagome-chan.

00:19:52.850 --> 00:19:54.070
Were you okay?

00:19:54.070 --> 00:19:55.250
Yeah.

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:56.430
Kagome,

00:19:58.350 --> 00:20:01.140
you're not useless at all.

00:20:01.140 --> 00:20:02.090
I'm impressed.

00:20:02.570 --> 00:20:04.440
Same here.

00:20:04.440 --> 00:20:06.550
Thanks for saving me.

00:20:08.930 --> 00:20:09.930
Woo-woo!

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:11.130
Looking hot.

00:20:11.130 --> 00:20:13.480
Shut up!

00:20:15.400 --> 00:20:17.480
Gosh, you made us worry.

00:20:18.300 --> 00:20:19.480
I'm sorry.

00:20:19.780 --> 00:20:21.800
You know, I was surprised.

00:20:21.800 --> 00:20:24.480
I didn't know you were so courageous.

00:20:24.480 --> 00:20:25.150
Yeah.

00:20:25.150 --> 00:20:26.830
You were great.

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:28.860
Of course.

00:20:28.860 --> 00:20:33.790
With such great sisters, Kagome-dono is bound to be great.

00:20:34.410 --> 00:20:37.250
Thank you for saving me, as well.

00:20:38.490 --> 00:20:41.140
Now, take off that wet t-shirt.

00:20:41.140 --> 00:20:41.800
But, it's...

00:20:42.010 --> 00:20:43.380
You'll catch a cold.

00:20:43.900 --> 00:20:44.540
Wait.

00:20:44.540 --> 00:20:45.760
Don't pull so much.

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:56.820
Kagome, what happened to your breasts?

00:20:59.700 --> 00:21:03.860
I wanted to be small like Ayame-oneechan...

00:21:02.230 --> 00:21:03.860
Could it be...

00:21:03.860 --> 00:21:07.740
that you didn't swim because you didn't want to show that?

00:21:09.800 --> 00:21:11.210
Kagome!

00:21:11.210 --> 00:21:14.310
Yours were like mine until just recently!

00:21:15.860 --> 00:21:21.000
Kagome-dono still keeps hiding them by restraining them with cloth.

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:25.260
I think she's fine just the way she is.

00:21:25.660 --> 00:21:29.550
I told her that too, but I guess she's still embarrassed.

00:21:29.950 --> 00:21:32.560
She doesn't want Masashi-kun to know.

00:21:32.730 --> 00:21:36.500
Girls are quite mysterious.

00:21:36.500 --> 00:21:40.310
Why is she embarrassed of such a fine development?

00:21:41.320 --> 00:21:42.570
Such fine...

00:21:44.050 --> 00:21:44.920
Hey!

00:21:44.920 --> 00:21:47.390
I'll show you what happens if you see my sister in that way!

00:21:47.390 --> 00:21:48.050
Hot!

00:21:48.050 --> 00:21:52.850
Ibuki-dono, you shouldn't point the firework over here!

00:21:53.750 --> 00:21:55.500
Like I said,

00:21:55.500 --> 00:21:57.820
we're all done for today.

00:21:57.820 --> 00:21:58.960
Come back tomorrow.

00:22:01.590 --> 00:22:05.620
By the way, Torigaya, haven't you shrunk?

00:22:05.620 --> 00:22:07.540
Of course I haven't.

00:22:09.140 --> 00:22:09.970
That's what I thought.

00:22:20.610 --> 00:22:27.110
I regret not realizing

00:22:28.060 --> 00:22:34.680
That you were the most important person to me

00:22:35.660 --> 00:22:42.240
I have to deliver these feelings to you myself

00:22:43.270 --> 00:22:51.700
Please, stay by my side forever

00:22:51.300 --> 00:22:55.930
The same feelings that were born through a dream

00:22:55.730 --> 00:22:59.690
Make me hesitate a little

00:22:59.560 --> 00:23:06.680
When I open my heart and free myself from sadness

00:23:06.560 --> 00:23:10.550
I will seize tomorrow with both of my hands

00:23:10.450 --> 00:23:14.400
I hope you will light up the dawn in my heart

00:23:14.440 --> 00:23:16.750
You're not alone

00:23:16.550 --> 00:23:21.080
Because I love you

00:23:21.520 --> 00:23:25.690
I know you're afraid of change

00:23:25.530 --> 00:23:29.110
So I promise to stay by your side, smiling

00:23:29.110 --> 00:23:36.710
Let's change kindness into strength

00:23:39.970 --> 00:23:41.980
Next Time!

00:23:41.980 --> 00:23:44.400
Morning to those out there.

00:23:41.980 --> 00:24:07.000
Eighth Longsword

00:23:41.980 --> 00:24:07.000
Back Then, You Were Bad

00:23:44.780 --> 00:23:46.480
This is Yoichi's father.

00:23:46.480 --> 00:23:51.780
Being super popular from this corner, it's already the eighth episode.

00:23:52.080 --> 00:23:57.070
With ridiculous contents, I'm sure the good boys and girls get very excited,

00:23:57.070 --> 00:23:59.950
but watch out for your lecturing mom.

00:23:59.950 --> 00:24:02.640
The protagonist of the next episode is Wassan.

00:24:02.640 --> 00:24:06.630
We'll dive into the mystery of his super-high spirit.

00:24:06.630 --> 00:24:08.220
So keep that in mind.

00:24:07.000 --> 00:24:10.000
Don't miss the next episode!

00:24:08.220 --> 00:24:09.790
Hey, how much?
